{"text": "Jemima flew over the treetops. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And saw an open place. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the wood. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She landed rather heavily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And waddled about to find a dry place for a nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She liked a tree stump. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Among some tall foxgloves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But a well dressed gentleman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was sitting on the stump. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Reading a newspaper. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had black pointed ears. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And sandy whiskers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was sitting on his long bushy tail. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Because the stump was a little damp. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Madam, have you lost your way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He asked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jemima thought. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That he was very polite and handsome. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She told him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That she was looking for a dry place to make a nest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have a sackful of feathers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In my wood shed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said the gentleman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You may sit there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As long as you like.", "alignment": {"characters": ["J", "e", "m", "i", "m", "a", " ", "f", "l", "e", "w", " ", "o", "v", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", "o", "p", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "a", "n", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", " ", "p", "l", "a", "c", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "o", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "n", "d", "e", "d"